ss_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","review_id":"lkeBcBjPsofKup3RvLCUBQ","date":"2022-01-04T03:56:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.920224666595459,"text_excerpt":"So we are walking around the French Quarter trying to find a bar where we can watch the Georgia-Michigan game and my niece knew a dive that she had gone to at a bachelorette party earlier in the year. This was the only place we visited in New Orleans that checked our vaxx cards. So we walk in to this place and there are three sections. The first section is a bar with games and a ceiling. The second section is an outside stage, a small building with a kitchen, and an outdoor grill. This section has tall brick walls and no ceiling. The last section is behind the kitchen building with some long tables and again no ceiling. While we were drinking we could smell the oysters being grilled. We o..."},{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","review_id":"uLxoBPRtq2XXFJTMKiU7Ig","date":"2018-12-21T16:54:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.919756293296814,"text_excerpt":"came here as a stop on a haunted tour. i love the hidden back patio, i highly suggest grabbing a drink and heading out over there. also, there is a small window to order food from. i only had one drink, but the hurricane was the most unique one i had while in NOLA. for one, its orange. two, its made with real juice. let me tell you, it was made well and went down smooth. the bar itself seemed really cool and had a great local vibe. my only complaint is the bathrooms, very small and not private at all so keep that in mind."},{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","review_id":"uvJPAReYZsjuV7168W2XLQ","date":"2021-10-13T01:05:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9194499850273132,"text_excerpt":"One of the few bars in the quarter that is mostly locals and not tourists. It's got a great patio with great bar food and known for their oysters. I'd give it a 4/5 to watch games however because the 2 Sundays I went they had audio issues making it difficult to watch the saints game. Other than that, 5/5! Highly recommend their frozen drinks and oysters!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","photo_id":"QaRaJCeYngMD8pZsAkqBIQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/QaRaJCeYngMD8pZsAkqBIQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9288922548294067},{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","photo_id":"ihEj_F5BCy2GUB8Nkt6uDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ihEj_F5BCy2GUB8Nkt6uDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8749864101409912},{"business_id":"CR8n4CVq19UqPpJlapQ7jg","photo_id":"OLEcilLk5whgdu3Y6QLg7Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OLEcilLk5whgdu3Y6QLg7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8667913675308228}]},"notebook_case":null}
